{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3e934d14-13dc-8ff4-b842-75efc3a71f07",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T09:26:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Brendan Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:18:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. Can you hear me all right? I've got you on the speaker, my hands are full of paper here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Brendan Cullen. I'm calling about a fox. There's a fox running around my neighborhood and I want to know who deals with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A fox. Okay. Is it bothering anybody, or did you just see it go by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I saw it at, um, [pause] it was ten past eleven yesterday morning. Broad daylight. Sitting in my yard like it paid the mortgage. I don't think that's right. They're supposed to be out at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that does surprise people. Did it look sick, or was it acting strange? Stumbling, drooling, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, I wrote it down. [pause] I've got it somewhere here. Here. I wrote, quote, thin, patchy tail, walked in a circle, then sat. That's what I wrote."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, patchy tail. That's worth reporting. Did it come near you or a pet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I stayed on the porch and looked at it through the glass. I don't have a dog. It just sat there, and then it left across the back fence when I knocked on the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, you did the right thing keeping your distance. So you asked who responds. For a wild animal that's not injured or aggressive, it's usually the animal control officer who takes the report, and they decide what to do from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's the city, then. Not the state, not the, what do you call it, the wildlife people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:21:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city takes the call first. If it needs the state, the officer passes it along. I'd just get your report to animal control."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:21:32-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Because I called somebody else first and they sent me to you, and you sent me to somebody, and that's three phone calls on a Monday morning. I have things to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:21:51-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, sorry about the runaround. I can put you through to animal control right now, or take down the details and send them over myself. Which would you like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:22:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take it down. I'm not sitting on hold, I did that already at the first place. They played music at me for ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:22:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll write it up. Can I get your address where you saw it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not say it on the speaker phone. Just say it was in the neighborhood, near my house. You've got my number, I'll give it. It's four oh one, five five five, oh one nine nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, oh one nine nine. I'd like the location for the officer, though, otherwise they won't know where to look. Could you at least give me the street or a landmark?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh. Fine. No, you know, I'll let the officer ask me when they call. I'm not giving the whole street to a speaker phone. Tell them to call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. I'll note that the caller will give the location directly. Fox seen around eleven ten Sunday morning, thin with a patchy tail, walked in a circle, left over a back fence. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Read it to me again, the tail part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:23:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thin, patchy tail, walked in a circle, then sat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:23:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Put down also I'm a photographer. Freelance. I'm between two bookings right now, so I'm home during the day and I can be reached. That's why I noticed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:24:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's helpful, daytime availability. I'll add that. Maybe you got a picture of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did not. My camera was in the other room. Of course. Fifty years of it and the one time something walks up, the bag is in the closet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Isn't that always how it goes. Well, if it comes back, don't go out after it. Just call us or the animal control line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not going out after anything. I'm eighty-some years old. I want somebody whose job it is to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. So the officer should be in touch. I can't tell you exactly when, it depends on their day, but I'll mark it so they see it today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today. That's what I'd like. Because if it's sick, it shouldn't be wandering around where kids walk to school."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Agreed. That's the right concern, and I'll flag that in the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:25:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. And if nobody calls me by tomorrow I'm calling back, and I'll ask for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. It's Sandra. Anything else I can do for you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:25:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's it. Thank you. Sorry if I sounded short, it's been a morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all, Mr. Cullen. Take care, and keep warm out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
